WEBVTT

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:04.700
Since ancient times, Japan has been known as the country of the gods.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.450
From the sea to the mountains, from a single tree to a single stone,

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:13.890
gods were believed to dwell in all things.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:19.720
And now we arrive at the lair of the very Gods of Misfortune themselves:

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.300
Fort Mis.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:26.200
Right now, the balance of fortune and misfortune in the human world is severely lopsided.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:30.550
It is our job as Gods of Misfortune to preserve that balance.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.230
Momiji, please go to the human world.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.120
To be honest, that sounds like a fuckin' pain.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.730
That was a bit <i>too</i> honest.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:42.970
A-Anyway, this is your target for today.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:44.990
How...

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:48.490
How can this girl be so <i>stacked</i>?

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:50.060
There's no way, right?

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:52.950
I bet they're tiny in real life!

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.400
Goddamnit, this girl pisses me off!

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.870
You're so easy to provoke.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:00.960
Now hurry off to the human world and fix this imbalance at its source:

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.300
Sakura Ichiko.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.180
Well, I guess it's time to get to work.

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:08.200
Yes, please.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:08.720
Oh...

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:14.500
While I'm away, could you record a TV show for me?

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.980
Just go already!

00:02:57.690 --> 00:03:00.030
Have a pleasant day, Miss Ichiko.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.240
Thanks. You too.

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:07.910
Good morning, Sakura!

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:08.910
Good morning.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:09.660
Good morning!

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:10.960
Here are your shoes!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.420
I'll carry your bag!

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:13.330
Thanks again!

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:16.920
Correct!

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:23.140
Oh, you're too kind!

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.140
What a fucking bitch.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.260
Sakura Ichiko.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.520
You mean Tittyko?

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.020
She's far too lucky for her own good.

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:32.650
If you're gonna have big tits, at least be dumb for Christ's sake.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:34.730
I know, right? Wish she'd just hurry up and die already.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.440
I just wanna fry her with a magnifying glass like the little bitch ant she is.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.610
I just wanna squeeze that pretty li'l neck 'til she chokes.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:49.580
That's all those lowlifes can come up with?!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:54.920
Your jealously just makes me wanna try even harder!

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.800
I've had sixteen years of nothing but good fortune!

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:03.800
I'm hot, I'm rich, and I've never had to worry about a thing!

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:05.850
Every light in front of me is green!

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:09.180
This must be the very <i>definition</i> of a rosy life!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:13.900
It's a pity, but people just aren't born equal, you know?

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:16.860
Don't hate on me just 'cos you were unlucky enough to be born into an average—

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.200
Wh-What?

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.040
What was that?

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:32.960
To the little girl who looks down on average people:

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:41.340
I've come from the land of misfortune to put you back in your rightful place!

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:42.970
How ya doin'?

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.340
Huh?

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.760
<i>What the flying fuck was that!?</i>

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:52.180
Hey, you! Don't run in the hallway!

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.520
Please save me!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:58.190
There's a creepy pervert in the bathroom!

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.270
What!?

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.860
Let's fuckin' get 'em!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.610
We're in the middle of class!

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.620
What're you talking about? There's no one here.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.240
All right, get back to class.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:16.750
Miss Ichiko, your bath is ready.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:17.920
Thanks, Suwano.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:28.300
What could that have been?

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.720
I'm sure it wasn't just my imagination...

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:33.680
Huh?

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.060
Did I do that right?

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:43.030
Are you all right, Miss Ichiko?

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.440
Who the fuck are you?!

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:47.910
Get outta here!

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:53.330
So that's how it's gonna be, huh?

00:05:56.210 --> 00:06:01.250
Excuse me! Is anyone there!? It's Momiji from the Gods of Misfortune!

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.210
May I come in?

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:03.750
Thanks!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.800
Wha... Wha... Wha...

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.430
You goddamn monster!

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:14.470
Sorry to say it, but you humans can't even touch me when I'm in this form.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.440
Though I can't do anything either.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:22.610
You... Just what <i>are</i> you?

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.650
I am Momiji, a God of Misfortune.

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.570
I've come here... from da Country o' Gods.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.070
God of Misfortune?

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.240
That's right.

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.450
Then why are you here?

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.000
Well, you see,

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.960
I've come to make you into a normal person.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.750
You kiddin' me?

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.920
It's very rare to see someone with this much Fortune.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:49.090
And on top of that, you're probably draining the Fortune out of other people when you—

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:51.140
I don't even know what you're talking about!

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.220
What's this crap supposed to let you see?

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:58.060
It measures Fortune and Misfortune levels.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.230
Ugh. That sounds gross.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.060
Believe me now?

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.570
Listen up.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:08.320
All living things are born with an inherent ability to be successful.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:12.070
We measure this as a form of energy that we call "Fortune".

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:17.660
The opposite form of this energy is "Misfortune", which brings calamity and ruin.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:23.170
However, the balance between these two forms of energy has recently been disturbed.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:27.880
And you, Sakura Ichiko, are the cause.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:30.800
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:35.050
I don't know if you're the reincarnation of some god, or if you were just an accident,

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:39.520
but you possess far more Fortune than any normal human.

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:47.150
That in itself is not ze problem, but you're takin' ze Fortune zat ozzer folks're due.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.030
Why are you talking like Lupin?

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:54.530
All right, so if my Fortune levels drop
and I become a normal person like you said,

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.740
what'll happen to me after that?

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.240
Allow me to show you.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:01.500
Good evening. This is Momiji.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.750
In the near future, Ichiko fails her college entrance exams,

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.750
loses her house, and finds herself on the streets.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:12.010
However, she soon meets a "real nice" guy

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.510
and ends up marrying him.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:18.600
She has five children, and together they have a "warm and caring" family.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.890
I look miserable!

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:22.770
That's the future that awaits you.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.020
You should totally do it.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.900
That's easy for <i>you</i> to say!

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.320
The details aren't exact, but you get the idea.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.780
However, your Fortune levels aren't the main problem.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:38.370
You might not be aware of this, but if you continue to unwittingly drain others of their Fortune,

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:42.080
you'll bring ruin to everyone you hold dear.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:45.000
I have two goals:

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:49.960
To stop you from draining others of their Fortune,

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:54.880
and to take some of your ridiculously abundant Fortune and return it to where it belongs.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.300
Y-You think I'm just gonna let you?!

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:00.770
You want <i>me</i> to end up as a bum on the streets just so other people can be happy?

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:02.980
You better be kiddin' me, you self-righteous hobo god!

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:05.640
Oh, I see.

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:06.900
You may be a god,

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:12.490
but aren't you more like the God of Flatness than the God of Misfortune?

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:19.330
Maybe <i>you</i> should get all that useless blubber sucked out!

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:20.790
Mind your own business!

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:23.370
I don't need your consent.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.790
I can complete one part of my mission here and now.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:29.710
What the hell is that creepy doll?

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:34.510
This is a Gadget of Misfortune!

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:35.970
Uh...

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:40.010
Mister Tanaka? It's time for your lethal in-<i>death</i>-tion!

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.600
Did you come up with that just then?

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.640
Commencing extraction.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:46.440
What the—

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.900
Are you seriously going to stick that thing into me!?

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:51.400
Don't worry, don't worry.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.650
This will hurt quite a lot!

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.780
What the hell? You trying to kill me?!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.740
It moves!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:02.950
Good job, Teddy! Now just hold her there!

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:06.960
Huh?

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:09.580
Hang in there, Teddy!

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:15.630
You think a few bars will hold me?

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:18.050
Did you forget I can float through any obstruction?

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.050
Then why'd you have to <i>smash</i> through it?!

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:21.890
My apologies.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:35.030
You goddamn... thief...

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.910
Suwano!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:47.960
Suwano, wake up.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.540
My word. How did I get here?

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:52.590
Quit lying around.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:54.590
Get rid of these for me.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.210
Oh?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.970
Your friends have the most wonderful hobbies.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:01.550
Don't get any ideas, you old creep!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:08.810
Ugh... I can't believe I let that little girl get the better of me.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:13.190
Don't rub it in.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:16.610
What is she, the reincarnation of a God of Fortune?

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:19.990
What're you making that face for?

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:21.950
Open your eyes and drive.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:24.030
My apologies.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:27.830
It's just that this is the first time
Miss Ichiko has brought a friend home.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:29.040
We're not friends.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.750
But you're her butler, you say?

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.580
Must be hard for you,

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:36.420
taking care of someone like that.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.340
Not at all.

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:44.430
I've been by Miss Ichiko's side since she could barely walk.

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:53.440
All of Miss Ichiko's memories, whether happy or sad, are important to me.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:56.440
I hope you'll continue to be there for her as her friend.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.980
I told you, we're not friends.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:02.660
Miss Ichiko is actually very lonely.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:05.910
You've got to be kidding me.

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:09.790
By the way, where would you like me to drop you off?

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.250
Now you ask?

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:14.000
I have returned.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:17.500
Suwano, don't let her in here anymore.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:22.260
Again with this... Isn't she a good friend of yours?

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:24.130
There's nothing good about her! She's an enemy!

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:29.180
Suwano?

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:33.810
That reminds me. It's your birthday tomorrow, isn't it?

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.150
Oh, that's right.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:38.400
I'm looking forward to your terrible cooking, Suwano!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:42.400
I'll do my best to make something edible for you.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.150
Miss Sakura!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.870
Happy birthday!

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:51.000
You guys shut up! Miss Sakura prefers the Japanese version!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:57.000
<i>If only that stupid robber of a god hadn't shown up, everything'd be just peachy.</i>

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.960
Setup complete.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:04.010
I'm gonna enjoy seeing her get what's coming to her.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.890
Gadget of Misfortune: Gabriel 2011!

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:12.520
A wonderful item that drains Fortune while simultaneously trapping the victim's leg!

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:14.690
Ah, crap.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:19.610
Excusez-moi...

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:26.280
Oh dear.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.280
What was that?

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:30.990
Are you alright?

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:34.000
You're Teddy, right?

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:40.000
What the hell?

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:43.340
Did something happen? Is <i>she</i> behind this as well?

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:45.010
What the hell's going on!?

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:46.590
Ah...

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:52.350
Screw this. Seriously.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.310
He had a sudden heart attack?

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:58.650
Yes. It's good that he was found quickly.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.690
But please be prepared for the worst.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.030
Does he have any family?

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:09.570
No. His wife died four years ago, so I'm the closest thing to family he has.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.410
What are you doing, Suwano?

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:15.540
Why are you sleeping there?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:19.040
That's not where your bed is.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:32.260
Too sweet!

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:34.970
Jeez, enough sugar for you, Suwano?

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:37.640
It's friggin' massive, too.

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:39.350
He'll be hearing about this when he gets back.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:48.450
Suwano... How can it be my birthday if you're not here for it?

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:53.370
I hate Mom and Dad! They couldn't even show up for my birthday!

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:56.500
Same as last year! And the year before that!

00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:00.460
Suwano, you'll stay with me, right? You'll always be around, right?

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.460
Of course.

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:06.880
I'll always be with you, Miss Ichiko.

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:15.390
Suwano, no! You <i>can't</i> die!

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.520
Way too sweet.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.900
Sweeter than a Japanese politician's backroom deals.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:24.190
What the hell are you doing?

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.900
I'm eating cake.

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:27.900
You did this, didn't you?

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:29.320
No.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.820
You made Suwano like that!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.570
I did not.

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:34.700
<i>You</i> did.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.200
I tried to warn you.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:42.210
Suwano has run out of Fortune.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:47.840
After living with you for so long, he's had it all drained away.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:52.470
<i>You want </i>me<i> to end up as a bum on the streets just so other people can be happy?</i>

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.930
<i>You better be kiddin' me!</i>

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:59.520
Happiness is something to be shared, you know.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:05.020
No matter how delicious the cake might be, if you don't have someone to share it with, you might as well not have any.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.730
I...

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:11.740
I don't have any misfortune, dammit!

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:15.950
You still have no misfortune.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:21.460
But if you keep dragging down the people around you like with Suwano, who knows?

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:25.790
Fine. You win.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:26.960
Do whatever you want.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.960
A wise decision.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:34.470
That's it. Well done.

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:38.720
You might have some bad luck at first as a result of being drained of so much Fortune at once,

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:43.730
but give it time and you'll stabilize into a normal person.

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:46.360
I see. That's good to hear.

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:50.980
To be honest, I was a bit tired of being special.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.240
I've had a good run.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:53.360
Yeah.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:55.110
...Yeah?

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:58.370
Like hell I was!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:16:59.950
You moron!

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:04.330
You think I'd give my Fortune to a preachy bum like you?

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:05.830
Later!

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:09.880
Haha...

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.420
What was that?

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:13.050
Was she serious?

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:15.550
Does she really want to...

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:17.840
<i>really</i> want to see what happens...

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.220
when you fucking piss me off?!

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:34.820
This is catastrophic!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:38.820
I'm done with just trying to bring you misfortune.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.620
I'm gonna <i>fucking kill you</i>!

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.960
<i>But isn't that the job of the Grim Reaper, not the God of Misfortune?</i>

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:46.330
I don't give a shit!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.960
I'm gonna take your fucking soul!

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:50.590
Run, my <i>purr</i>ties!

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:07.940
Just gotta get to the operating room!

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:13.650
Now you've done it.

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:17.200
You intend to save Suwano with that?

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:21.330
So I <i>can</i> save him if I use this.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:24.540
I was starting to wonder if it was even possible.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.040
<i>Dammit.</i>

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.370
Stand aside!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:30.710
You think I'm gonna let you do whatever the fuck you want?!

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:34.340
Well, crap.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:36.420
You think a written apology will cover this?

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:41.010
Seriously?

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.560
They all have four leaves!

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.850
Doctor! We're out of time!

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:48.890
Come on...

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:50.600
Suwano.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.650
Suwano.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:54.610
Suwano!

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:59.780
Hang in there, Suwano!

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:03.780
Thank you, Miss Ichiko.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.370
You have to come back.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:11.000
I'm not done with you yet! You hear me?

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:24.050
I'm sorry to have ruined your birthday.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:28.180
You'd better be! I got all worried for nothing!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.890
I'll accept any punishment you impose upon me.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:32.810
Well, okay.

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:34.110
In that case, Suwano...

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:34.560
Yes?

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.900
You're fired.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:37.570
Okay.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:39.400
What?

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:46.490
You walked in on me in the bath, ruined my birthday, and made my cake <i>way</i> too sweet.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:47.450
I mean...

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:52.960
You still have like 30 years left, don't you?

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:57.340
Go somewhere where the air is fresh.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:01.970
Find someone, and start a new family.

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.970
Miss Ichiko...

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.470
Thank you very much.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:10.390
I-I'm firing you! You better take it seriously!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:11.560
Is that so?

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:12.480
Yeah.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.480
I guess you're right.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:16.900
Miss Ichiko.

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:21.240
Thank you for everything.

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:25.490
Yeah. Thank you too.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:27.870
This is for the best.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:30.830
If he stayed with me, he'd be in danger.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.620
It's a no-brainer!

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:36.130
I've basically been alone up until now anyway.

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:39.880
That's right. It's a no-brainer.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:46.390
That bum of a god hasn't shown up since. I wonder if she went back home.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:49.890
It's been a week since then. Living alone isn't so bad.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.020
I'm back!

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.310
Welcome home!

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:57.860
How was your day, darling? Would you like dinner? Or a bath?

00:20:57.860 --> 00:20:59.020
Or how about...

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:00.820
a little misfortune?

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:03.820
That sounds lovely! But first, do tell me...

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:06.070
What the fuck do you think you're doing?!

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:12.700
Hmm... Looks like your Fortune is back up to its usual level.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:19.500
So in short, that Fortune you spread around last time ended up comin' right back to you.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.460
Oh, I see. So what now?

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:23.920
Wanna do it... one more time?

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:25.380
How about no?

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:26.380
Don't sass me!

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.300
Shut the fuck up!

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.310
Just try it, you hag!

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:35.350
Why, you little..

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:36.940
You friggin' God of Misfortune!

00:23:06.940 --> 00:23:08.530
Go fuck yourself, thunder-tits!

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:10.660
Wanna say that again, washboard?!

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:11.360
What!?

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:12.530
I have a delivery!

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:14.280
Oh, it's from Suwano!

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:18.080
<i>We're getting married.</i>

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:19.960
That was fast!

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:23.880
This week's <i>Nadeshiko</i>!

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:26.630
Thanks for waiting, everyone!

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:30.880
We hope you enjoyed this week's show.

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:33.430
Now then, one more time!
